### Docker / secrets (Phase 6) ###
# Real env files with secrets are never committed — only the .env.example templates are.
# (This used to re-include frontend/.env, which meant that file was tracked. Removed: every
# .env, at any depth, is now ignored. Copy frontend/.env.example to frontend/.env locally.)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!frontend/.env.example

# Private keys / certificates / keystores / credential dumps
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
secrets/
credentials.json

